# Base URL of the Taskline API, WITHOUT /api.
#   Deployed backend:            https://taskline-api.onrender.com
#   Android emulator -> your PC: http://10.0.2.2:4000
#   Phone on the same Wi-Fi:     http://192.168.x.x:4000   (your computer's LAN IP)
# If left empty in development, the app uses the IP of the computer running Metro on port 4000.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
